NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the source code, tests and documentation in this repository.

It does not cover the NIAT Masterclass competition data (the ten knowledge-base
documents, test.csv and sample_submission.csv), which is not distributed here —
`data/raw/` is gitignored precisely because the competition rules prohibit
redistributing it. Obtain that data from the competition directly.

`data/validation/answer_key.yaml` IS covered by this licence: it is an original
hand-built annotation of the 50 test questions, produced for this project.
